# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill in. NEVER commit real values.
#
# The game's TEST key (it only returns test-code data). Read in Node only, by the `npm run dev` /
# `npm run preview` stand-in for the nginx proxy (vite.config.ts). It has no VITE_ prefix on purpose:
# Vite never puts it in the JavaScript players download. The browser only ever calls ./api/user-items.
# NEVER put the LIVE key here: the live key lives only in the server's nginx proxy (README → Deploy).
# Without a key, the game still plays with the free starter towers (and, from milestone 3, the bundled demo profiles).
THEOSWAP_API_KEY=

# Optional: point the local proxy at another TheoSwap host (e.g. a local dev server).
THEOSWAP_URL=https://www.theoswap.io

# Optional: where `npm run deploy` uploads dist/ with rsync (user@host:/folder/).
DEPLOY_TARGET=
